# Every key once on the perc track with the default preset (marimba): two chromatic octaves F3 .. E5, each hit
# must sound and free its voice.
tempo 240
steps 96
tail 2.5
track perc
preset 32 128 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 0 53 1 120
note 4 54 1 120
note 8 55 1 120
note 12 56 1 120
note 16 57 1 120
note 20 58 1 120
note 24 59 1 120
note 28 60 1 120
note 32 61 1 120
note 36 62 1 120
note 40 63 1 120
note 44 64 1 120
note 48 65 1 120
note 52 66 1 120
note 56 67 1 120
note 60 68 1 120
note 64 69 1 120
note 68 70 1 120
note 72 71 1 120
note 76 72 1 120
note 80 73 1 120
note 84 74 1 120
note 88 75 1 120
note 92 76 1 120
expect sound 0 96
expect idle 130
expect peak_below 0
